Th-The hollow sample size is too large.

291
00:21:16.458 --> 00:21:17.583
The mainframe is still
analyzing and tracking—

292
00:21:17.666 --> 00:21:18.542
Enough!

293
00:21:18.625 --> 00:21:19.833
Don't say another word!

294
00:21:20.166 --> 00:21:22.666
Give me the current density chart. dear.

295
00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:30.416
The coordinates are offset 35.23 north.

296
00:21:31.083 --> 00:21:32.083
Ah. found it!

297
00:21:32.166 --> 00:21:33.166
Unbelievable!

298
00:21:45.166 --> 00:21:47.583
So that's where the
source of the hollows is.

299
00:21:47.958 --> 00:21:49.417
Wasn't that obvious?

300
00:21:49.500 --> 00:21:51.000
A bunch of idiots!

301
00:21:51.375 --> 00:21:52.416
Let's move!

302
00:22:06.500 --> 00:22:08.000
KICK SODA.

303
00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:12.375
When this first came out long ago.

304
00:22:12.458 --> 00:22:13.750
it tasted so awful

305
00:22:13.833 --> 00:22:15.333
that production stopped
right after launch.

306
00:22:15.875 --> 00:22:17.791
Yet this store kept selling it.

307
00:22:18.833 --> 00:22:20.783
Even though it's labeled orange flavor.

308
00:22:22.000 --> 00:22:23.041
it tastes

309
00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:25.916
like burning straw.

310
00:22:28.541 --> 00:22:30.333
But I don't dislike that taste.

311
00:22:32.791 --> 00:22:33.833
Somehow.

312
00:22:34.583 --> 00:22:36.125
it tastes like memories.

313
00:22:38.166 --> 00:22:40.125
But where that feeling comes from.

314
00:22:41.291 --> 00:22:42.916
I can't remember anymore.

315
00:22:44.291 --> 00:22:45.791
Speaking of which.

316
00:22:46.666 --> 00:22:48.500
being able to buy this drink here

317
00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:50.333
is practically a miracle.

318
00:22:51.666 --> 00:22:52.666
The last can...

319
00:22:53.333 --> 00:22:54.983
I can't bring myself to drink it.

320
00:23:04.666 --> 00:23:05.916
Don't run off!

321
00:23:14.583 --> 00:23:15.583
Huh?

322
00:23:16.791 --> 00:23:17.791
What am I doing?

323
00:23:35.166 --> 00:23:36.166
Huh?

324
00:23:36.875 --> 00:23:37.667
Yi...

325
00:23:37.750 --> 00:23:39.000
Is she here already?

326
00:23:40.666 --> 00:23:41.833
Oh no...

327
00:23:42.500 --> 00:23:43.666
Sleep paralysis again.

328
00:23:51.416 --> 00:23:52.541
Absurd Justice!

329
00:23:52.875 --> 00:23:54.041
Absurd Justice!

330
00:23:54.291 --> 00:23:55.208
Absurd Justice!

331
00:23:55.416 --> 00:23:56.791
Split into teams and
move in! - Absurd Justice!

332
00:23:57.083 --> 00:23:58.000
Absurd Justice!

333
00:23:58.958 --> 00:23:59.875
Out of the way.

334
00:23:59.958 --> 00:24:00.833
Leader.

335
00:24:01.083 --> 00:24:02.875
Everyone. move out!

336
00:24:02.958 --> 00:24:05.125
You idiots. get out of my way!

337
00:24:18.833 --> 00:24:19.708
Boss.

338
00:24:19.791 --> 00:24:21.708
is that moment almost here?

339
00:24:57.708 --> 00:24:58.708
He's coming.

340
00:26:11.041 --> 00:26:11.500
Hello.

341
00:26:11.583 --> 00:26:12.625
Guan Chao.

342
00:26:12.958 --> 00:26:14.000
I'm Fang Tang.

343
00:26:15.500 --> 00:26:17.083
This is the Memory Collection Depot.

344
00:26:17.166 --> 00:26:19.116
under the Memory Administration Bureau.

345
00:26:20.000 --> 00:26:22.150
It collects memories
people no longer need.

346
00:26:22.291 --> 00:26:23.417
In other words.

347
00:26:23.500 --> 00:26:24.750
from this moment on.

348
00:26:24.833 --> 00:26:27.041
everything you see and feel is memory.

349
00:26:27.291 --> 00:26:28.250
Including this.

350
00:26:28.333 --> 00:26:29.708
which somebody apparently forgot—

351
00:26:29.791 --> 00:26:31.250
this incredibly annoying

352
00:26:31.333 --> 00:26:32.683
earthquake washing machine!

353
00:26:39.833 --> 00:26:40.791
Bai Zhong.

354
00:26:41.000 --> 00:26:42.083
this is an important memory object.

355
00:26:42.166 --> 00:26:44.250
Wasn't I introducing it to him?

356
00:26:44.333 --> 00:26:45.291
Besides.

357
00:26:45.500 --> 00:26:47.666
is now really the time
to pull a sneak attack?

358
00:26:47.833 --> 00:26:49.125
It didn't work anyway.

359
00:26:49.208 --> 00:26:49.958
Wait...

360
00:26:50.041 --> 00:26:51.208
What is this place?

361
00:26:51.833 --> 00:26:53.666
I need to get back to Hongpai Port.

362
00:26:54.833 --> 00:26:55.500
Boss.

363
00:26:55.583 --> 00:26:56.750
why does he have that halo?

364
00:26:56.833 --> 00:26:57.750
What is this?

365
00:26:57.833 --> 00:26:58.833
A halo?

366
00:26:59.041 --> 00:27:00.000
Guan Chao.

367
00:27:00.458 --> 00:27:01.458
you're already dead.

368
00:27:02.250 --> 00:27:03.042
What?

369
00:27:03.125 --> 00:27:04.083
Why?

370
00:27:04.333 --> 00:27:04.875
No...

371
00:27:04.958 --> 00:27:06.250
I still have so many
important things to do.

372
00:27:06.333 --> 00:27:07.042
You must

373
00:27:07.125 --> 00:27:08.525
know how to get back. right?

374
00:27:09.166 --> 00:27:10.125
Catch.

375
00:27:11.541 --> 00:27:13.666
This is a container used
to collect BUG Beings.

376
00:27:13.833 --> 00:27:14.791
A floppy disk?

377
00:27:15.375 --> 00:27:16.792
What's she talking about?

378
00:27:16.875 --> 00:27:18.292
Take the elevator up.

379
00:27:18.375 --> 00:27:19.625
Fill up the container.

380
00:27:20.000 --> 00:27:21.542
and you'll return to your reality.

381
00:27:21.625 --> 00:27:22.625
There's no time.

382
00:27:22.833 --> 00:27:23.583
Bai Zhong. take him with you.

383
00:27:23.666 --> 00:27:24.583
Who?

384
00:27:24.750 --> 00:27:25.666
Me.

385
00:27:25.833 --> 00:27:27.000
W-Wait. I still haven't—

386
00:27:27.083 --> 00:27:28.667
But whether you make it out

387
00:27:28.750 --> 00:27:30.083
depends on you.

388
00:27:39.083 --> 00:27:40.333
If you keep wasting time.

389
00:27:40.416 --> 00:27:41.916
your memories will be eaten.

390
00:27:43.833 --> 00:27:44.791
In any case.

391
00:27:46.416 --> 00:27:48.616
welcome to the Memory
Administration Bureau.

392
00:27:56.375 --> 00:27:58.375
You're now a temporary collector.

393
00:28:01.000 --> 00:28:02.000
Guan Chao.

394
00:28:03.305 --> 00:29:03.443
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
